#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "56_Isawa"
msgid "*gasp* *wheeze* You mother... *cough*"
msgstr "*jadea* *suspira* Hijo de... *tose*"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "68_Fay"
msgid "Tanimura-san, are you okay? Are you hurt!?"
msgstr "Tanimura, ¿estás bien? ¿¡Te has hecho daño!?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "80_Isawa"
msgid "...You serious, Fay? You ain't just fuckin' with me? Are\\r\nyou really tryin' to do me dirty like this?"
msgstr "¿...en serio, Fay? ¿No te estás quedando conmigo?\\r\n¿De verdad me vas a joder de esta manera?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92_Fay"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "104_Isawa"
msgid "Fine. I'll just step back and let you think about it... But\\r\ndon't forget that you'll never make it without me. You're a\\r\nnobody going nowhere in life. Oh, and enjoy your new prick."
msgstr "Bueno. Daré un paso al costado y te dejaré meditarlo...\\r\nPero no olvides que no eres nada sin mí. Una donnadie\\r\nsin rumbo por la vida. Ah, y disfruta de tu nueva verga."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176_Tanimura"
msgid "Are... you okay?"
msgstr "¿Estás... bien?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "188_Fay"
msgid "I am... now that it's over between Isawa and me. I can't thank you enough, Tanimura-san."
msgstr "Sí... ahora que terminó lo mío con Isawa sí. No puedo \\r agradecerte lo suficiente, Tanimura."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "200_Tanimura"
msgid "Well, at least he got <Italic>some</Italic> sense knocked into him...\\r\nBut it's fairly obvious that he's the type to hold a grudge.\\r\nI should give you my number so you can call me just in case."
msgstr "Bueno, al menos <Italic>alguna</Italic> idea le acomodé ahí arriba... Pero\\r \nes bastante obvio que es de los que guardan rencor.\\r \nDebería darte mi número por si acaso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "224_Fay"
msgid "Yes, please do that. That's... very thoughtful, Tanimura-san."
msgstr "Sí, por favor. Es... muy buena idea, Tanimura."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "260_Tanimura"
msgid "Well, I'm off. Hope your money makes it back home safely\\r\nfrom now on."
msgstr "Bueno, me voy. Espero que ahora el dinero llegue a casa\\r\nsin problemas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "272_Fay"
msgid "Yes... Oh, and before I forget... I'd like you to have this."
msgstr "Sí... Ah, antes de que me olvide... Quiero que te quedes \\r con esto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "308_Fay"
msgid "I guess this is goodbye... Maybe you can swing by my work sometime? Just a thought."
msgstr "Supongo que es un 'adiós'... Si quisieras te podrías pasar \\r por mi trabajo algún dia. Es solo una idea."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "344_Tanimura"
msgid "Whew... Never thought it'd feel so good to be single.\\r\nOn that note, I should get back to work myself."
msgstr "Uf... Nunca pensé que se sentiría tan bien ser soltero.\\r\nHablando de eso, debería volver a trabajar en mi mismo."

